.TH ULAUNCHER "1" "September 2026" "ulauncher 6.0.2" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
ulauncher \- Qt 6 Kirigami launcher matching Spotlight-goshos
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ulauncher
[\fI\,COMMAND\/\fR] [\fI\,OPTIONS\/\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
GoshLauncher is a Qt 6 + Kirigami launcher. Open with Ctrl+Space. Search
follows Spotlight\-goshos (URLs, paths, folders, bookmarks, apps, calculator,
units, color, clock, windows, system actions, Settings, recent files, then
web). Follows the system light/dark color scheme. Prefixes: = calc, @ web, #
settings, $ windows, . recents, ! command (off by default).
.SH APP COMMANDS
.TP
start
Start the GoshLauncher background process
.TP
show
Show the GoshLauncher window (default command)
.TP
toggle
Toggle the GoshLauncher window
.TP
\fB\-\-version\fR
Show version
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Show help
.SH EXTENSION COMMANDS
.TP
extensions (e)
List installed extensions
.TP
install (i)
Install an extension from URL
.TP
uninstall (rm)
Uninstall an extension
.TP
upgrade (up)
Upgrade extensions
.TP
preview (pr)
Preview extension
